-> invariant and concurrent-call protection once implemented.
+The domain action `App\Actions\CallNextTicket` implements this flow (modes and
+rules are in [`business-rules.md`](business-rules.md#call-panel-attendant)).
+The queue row lock serializes calls, issuance and deactivation for the same
+queue. `Ticket::call()` does not take that lock, so the candidate row is locked
+and re-checked before it is marked called; a ticket can be called only once.
+The action does not authorize the caller; the entry point must do so.
