+Automated coverage: `tests/Feature/CallNextTicketTest.php` (ordering, modes,
+fairness, inactive queue, exactly-once on sequential calls). The race where a
+concurrent `Ticket::call()` takes the candidate between selection and locking
+has no automated test yet; it is covered by the locking design only.
 
